# 换行符统一：文本文件在仓库与工作区均用 LF，避免两份检出互相漂移
* text=auto eol=lf

# 图片、音频等媒体资源不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.oga binary
*.m4a binary
*.aac binary
*.wma binary
*.ape binary
*.opus binary
*.mid binary
